                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9566bfe-6aac-3641-b804-93ddba41c741",
                        "entry_id": "071ab1ad-bedd-32a8-9878-dcaeb23ed230",
                        "glosses": [
                            "diep doordringend en voelbaar"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bcbbffa-0bfb-4242-bf23-e63d7e5f3ccc",
                                "sense_id": "a9566bfe-6aac-3641-b804-93ddba41c741",
                                "text": "De universiteit legt de bezuiniging, ingegeven door structurele tekorten bij aardwetenschappen, uit als een \"strategische keuze\" waarbij onderzoek en onderwijs zich nu gaan richten op de hedendaagse klimaatverandering en urgente vraagstukken als natuurrampen en klimaatsystemen. \"We begrijpen dat dit een ingrijpend plan is voor studenten en medewerkers. We doen onze uiterste best om in deze onzekere tijd betrokken medewerkers en studenten zo goed mogelijk te informeren.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e8904f6-2792-4bdf-8fa8-2d601c4b9b4a",
                        "source_entry_id": "071ab1ad-bedd-32a8-9878-dcaeb23ed230",
                        "source_sense_id": "a9566bfe-6aac-3641-b804-93ddba41c741",
                        "target_lang_word": "radical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "radical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b180c766-c82d-3e62-bcd9-122fdb264398",
                                        "entry_id": "8fe22fc3-06d2-33f8-b872-44aa07b570a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Favoring fundamental change, or change at the root cause of a matter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a285b61-b128-4ab8-bc2e-27ceac0649c2",
                                                "sense_id": "b180c766-c82d-3e62-bcd9-122fdb264398",
                                                "text": "His beliefs are radical."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3124a6e8-3c46-3a99-a18d-ab6883d99576",
                                        "entry_id": "8fe22fc3-06d2-33f8-b872-44aa07b570a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a root (of a plant)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b0f5d36-710c-3b69-b648-5552a7ac7bec",
                                        "entry_id": "8fe22fc3-06d2-33f8-b872-44aa07b570a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the basic or intrinsic nature of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b69c209-c737-4534-b28c-7cc6dc5302a0",
                                                "sense_id": "6b0f5d36-710c-3b69-b648-5552a7ac7bec",
                                                "text": "The most determined exertions of that authority, against them, only showed their radical independence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b41fe6e-d18a-3acf-90df-0d3ce8967672",
                                        "entry_id": "8fe22fc3-06d2-33f8-b872-44aa07b570a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Thoroughgoing; far-reaching."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d019f44d-ffd2-4b87-ac1e-8be3dbc05088",
                                                "sense_id": "2b41fe6e-d18a-3acf-90df-0d3ce8967672",
                                                "text": "The spread of the cancer required radical surgery, and the entire organ was removed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea0a4f96-aed8-4dc6-bd62-af9a69980aa2",
                                                "sense_id": "2b41fe6e-d18a-3acf-90df-0d3ce8967672",
                                                "text": "Phoenix and Lubbock are both caught in severe drought, and it is going to get much worse. We may see many such [dust] storms in the decades ahead, along with species extinctions, radical disturbance of ecosystems, and intensified social conflict over land and water. Welcome to the Anthropocene, the epoch when humans have become a major geological and climatic force."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efa69e74-6d1a-3c75-9d45-4bf02fb617dc",
                                        "entry_id": "8fe22fc3-06d2-33f8-b872-44aa07b570a0",
